1
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:06,500
For centuries, we have measured value through production.

2
00:00:07,333 --> 00:00:08,833
ÆPOCH begins somewhere else.

3
00:00:08,833 --> 00:00:10,667
Presence activates value.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:16,333
What we count shapes what we value: production, or presence.

5
00:00:17,333 --> 00:00:19,000
Show up. Activate.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,167
Circulate. What moves becomes permanent.

7
00:00:24,333 --> 00:00:27,500
Participation, not accumulation, defines power.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,500
One human. One vote.

9
00:00:31,333 --> 00:00:34,500
Different systems produce different realities:

10
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,500
extraction or contribution, concentration or flow.

11
00:00:38,333 --> 00:00:42,167
Presence activates value. Flow makes it permanent.

